# INTERACTION — when the user clicks the pet. Every frame derives from base.pet sit.
# Raised paw = the fox's left front paw (viewer's right): 2x2 w paw at cols 13-14, diagonal
# 2px arm (O shade left, o right) down to the shoulder at row 10; that paw's foot at row 14 becomes OO.

# Wave: paw raised beside the head (rows 5-6, as react wave), happy ^ ^ eyes, p blush on row 7, small p mouth.
